       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
      ******************************************************************
      *           I D E N T I F I C A T I O N   D I V I S I O N        *
      ******************************************************************
      * PROGRAM NAME
      ******************************************************************
       PROGRAM-ID. SWB4850.
      ******************************************************************
      *                                                                *
      *                      - MENSAGENS SWIFT -                       *
      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************
      * RECONSTRUÇÃO DOS TOTAIS DA TABELA SWT63                        *
      ******************************************************************
      *           L O G     D E     A L T E R A C O E S                *
      ******************************************************************
      *  INICIO  * AUTOR  * FIM    *  C O M E N T A R I O S            *
      *          *        *        *                                   *
      *          *        *        *                                   *
      ******************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
      ******************************************************************
      *           E N V I R O N M E N T         D I V I S I O N        *
      ******************************************************************
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                     CONFIGURATION SECTION                      *
      ******************************************************************
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM-AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.
           DECIMAL-POINT IS COMMA.
      ******************************************************************
       DATA DIVISION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                   D A T A   D I V I S I O N                    *
      ******************************************************************
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                    WORKING STORAGE SECTION                     *
      ******************************************************************
      * PROGRAM CONTROL
      ******************************************************************
       01  WS-PROGRAM-CONTROL.
           05 WS-PROGNAME               PIC  X(10) VALUE 'SWB4850'.
           05 WS-SWVT7201               PIC  X(10) VALUE 'SWVT7201'.
           05 WS-SWVT5805               PIC  X(10) VALUE 'SWVT5805'.
           05 WS-SWVT6302               PIC  X(10) VALUE 'SWVT6302'.

      ******************************************************************
      * CONSTANTES
      ******************************************************************
       01  WS-CONSTANTES.
           05 WS-RECONC                 PIC  X(02) VALUE 'RC'.
           05 WS-VALIDADA               PIC  X(02) VALUE 'VA'.
           05 CON-SIM                   PIC  X(01) VALUE 'S'.

      ******************************************************************
      * VARIAVEIS
      ******************************************************************
       01  WS-VARIAVEIS.
           05 WS-CBAN                   PIC  X(04).
           05 WS-CSPAI                  PIC  X(02).
           05 WS-GVALOR.
              10 WS-ANO                 PIC  9(04).
              10 FILLER                 PIC  X(50).
           05 WS-ANO-INI                PIC S9(04)  COMP-3.
           05 WS-ANO-FIM                PIC S9(04)  COMP-3.
           05 WS-DATA-INI               PIC S9(08)  COMP-3.
           05 WS-DATA-FIM               PIC S9(08)  COMP-3.
           05 WS-NANO                   PIC S9(04)  COMP-3.
           05 WS-COUNT                  PIC S9(15)  COMP-3.
           05 WS-MOVREC                 PIC S9(15)  COMP-3.
           05 WS-TEXREC                 PIC S9(15)  COMP-3.
           05 WS-MOVPEND                PIC S9(15)  COMP-3.
           05 WS-TEXPEND                PIC S9(15)  COMP-3.

      ******************************************************************
      * SWITCHES
      ******************************************************************
       01  WS-SWITCHES.
           05 WS-EXECUTA                PIC  X(01)  VALUE SPACES.
              88 WS-EXECUTA-SIM                     VALUE 'S'.
           05 WS-STATUS-SWT56           PIC S9(03)  VALUE 0.
              88 WS-SWT56-OK                        VALUE 0.
              88 WS-SWT56-NOTFND                    VALUE 100.
           05 WS-STATUS-SWT58           PIC S9(03)  VALUE 0.
              88 WS-SWT58-OK                        VALUE 0.
              88 WS-SWT58-NOTFND                    VALUE 100.
           05 WS-STATUS-SWT63           PIC S9(03)  VALUE 0.
              88 WS-SWT63-OK                        VALUE 0.
              88 WS-SWT63-NOTFND                    VALUE 100.

      ******************************************************************
      * COPYS
      ******************************************************************
           COPY AQCK0001.
           COPY AQCW0109.
           COPY SWCK0001.
           COPY SWCK0002.
           COPY SWCK0003.
           COPY ARCK0001.
           COPY VIAL0015.
           COPY VIAW0030.
           COPY AQCW0011.
PRA        COPY AQCW0009.

      ******************************************************************
      * DB2
      ******************************************************************
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD7201  END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD5805  END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD6302  END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA     END-EXEC.

           EXEC SQL
                DECLARE CRS_SWT63 CURSOR FOR
                 SELECT CBAN
                      , CSPAI
                      , TOPREC
                      , TEXREC
                      , TOPPEND
                      , TEXPEND
                      , CUSERID
                      , HTIMEEST
                      , NANO
                   FROM SWVT6302
                   WHERE NANO >= :WS-ANO-INI
                     AND NANO <= :WS-ANO-INI
                  ORDER BY CBAN, CSPAI, NANO
           END-EXEC.

      ******************************************************************
       LINKAGE SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                        LINKAGE SECTION                         *
      ******************************************************************
PRA   *    COPY AQCW0009.
PRA        COPY VIAL0005.
      ******************************************************************
PRA   *PROCEDURE DIVISION USING AQCW0009-DATA.
PRA        EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0014 END-EXEC.
      ******************************************************************
      *              P R O C E D U R E   D I V I S I O N               *
      ******************************************************************
       0000-MAINLINE.
      *
           PERFORM 1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
              THRU 1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              IF WS-EXECUTA-SIM
                 PERFORM 2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
                    THRU 2000-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT
              END-IF
           END-IF.

           PERFORM 3000-FIM-PROGRAMA
              THRU 3000-FIM-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

       0000-MAINLINE-EXIT.
           GOBACK.

      ******************************************************************
       1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA'      TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           INITIALIZE WS-VARIAVEIS.
           SET AQCW0009-RCODE-OK            TO TRUE.
           SET ETCL0002-SEM-ERROS           TO TRUE.

           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM AQCP0100-REG-INICIO
                 THRU AQCP0100-REG-INICIO-EXIT
           END-IF.

           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM AQCP0100-OBT-DADOS-ARQ
                 THRU AQCP0100-OBT-DADOS-ARQ-EXIT
           END-IF.

           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 1100-OBTER-PERIODO
                 THRU 1100-OBTER-PERIODO-EXIT
           END-IF.

       1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       1100-OBTER-PERIODO.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '1100-OBTER-PERIODO'        TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           INITIALIZE ARCL2205-DATA         REPLACING NUMERIC BY ZEROES
                                                 ALPHANUMERIC BY SPACES.

           MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC             TO ARCL2205-CAPLIC.
           MOVE SWCK0002-PARAM-TOTAISANO    TO ARCL2205-CPARAM.

           PERFORM CALL-ARM2206
              THRU CALL-ARM2206-EXIT.

           IF ETCL0002-SEM-ERROS
              MOVE ARCL2205-GVALOR1         TO WS-GVALOR
              MOVE WS-ANO                   TO WS-ANO-INI
              MOVE ARCL2205-GVALOR2         TO WS-GVALOR
              MOVE WS-ANO                   TO WS-ANO-FIM
              MOVE ARCL2205-GVALOR3         TO WS-EXECUTA
           ELSE
              IF  ETCL0002-ERROS-FUNCAO
              AND ETCL0002-NR-ERRO      EQUAL ARCK0001-REG-INEXISTENTE
              AND ETCL0002-CAPLIC-ERRO  EQUAL VIAK0002-APLIC-AR
                  SET  ETCL0002-SEM-ERROS   TO TRUE
                  MOVE ZEROES               TO ETCL0002-NR-ERRO
                  MOVE SPACES               TO ETCL0002-CAPLIC-ERRO
                  MOVE 0001                 TO WS-ANO-INI
                  MOVE 9999                 TO WS-ANO-FIM
              END-IF
           END-IF.

           IF NOT ETCL0002-SEM-ERROS
              SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-VAL       TO TRUE
              SET  VIAW0030-EXEC-ERROR      TO TRUE
              MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID       TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
              MOVE 'ERRO NA ARM2206'        TO VIAW0030-DESC1
              MOVE ETCL0002-AREA-ERRO       TO VIAW0030-DESC2
              MOVE ETCL0002-GINFO-ERRO      TO VIAW0030-DESC3
              PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                 THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-IF.

       1100-OBTER-PERIODO-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       2000-PROC-PROGRAMA.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '2000-PROC-PROGRAMA'        TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           PERFORM 2100-OPEN-CURSOR
              THRU 2100-OPEN-CURSOR-EXIT

           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2200-FETCH-CURSOR
                 THRU 2200-FETCH-CURSOR-EXIT

              PERFORM 2300-PROCESSA-CURSOR
                 THRU 2300-PROCESSA-CURSOR-EXIT
                      UNTIL NOT AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
                      OR    NOT AQCW0011-OK

              EXEC SQL CLOSE CRS_SWT63 END-EXEC
           END-IF.

       2000-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       2100-OPEN-CURSOR.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '2100-OPEN-CURSOR'          TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           EXEC SQL
                OPEN CRS_SWT63
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE WS-SWVT6302                 TO AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           EVALUATE TRUE
           WHEN AQCW0011-OK
                CONTINUE
           WHEN OTHER
                SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL     TO TRUE
                SET  VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR     TO TRUE
                MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID     TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
                MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME    TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
                MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE       TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
                PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                   THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.

       2100-OPEN-CURSOR-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       2200-FETCH-CURSOR.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '2200-FETCH-CURSOR'         TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
      *    IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
      *       PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
      *          THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
      *    END-IF.

           EXEC SQL
                FETCH CRS_SWT63
                 INTO :SWCD6302-CBAN
                    , :SWCD6302-CSPAI
                    , :SWCD6302-TOPREC
                    , :SWCD6302-TEXREC
                    , :SWCD6302-TOPPEND
                    , :SWCD6302-TEXPEND
                    , :SWCD6302-CUSERID
                    , :SWCD6302-HTIMEEST
                    , :SWCD6302-NANO
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE WS-SWVT6302                 TO AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           EVALUATE TRUE
           WHEN AQCW0011-OK
                MOVE SWCD6302-NANO          TO AQCW0005-DT98-A
                MOVE  1                     TO AQCW0005-DT98-M
                MOVE  1                     TO AQCW0005-DT98-D
                MOVE AQCW0005-DT98          TO WS-DATA-INI
                MOVE 12                     TO AQCW0005-DT98-M
                MOVE 31                     TO AQCW0005-DT98-D
                MOVE AQCW0005-DT98          TO WS-DATA-FIM
           WHEN AQCW0011-NOTFND
                CONTINUE
           WHEN OTHER
                SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL     TO TRUE
                SET  VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR     TO TRUE
                MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID     TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
                MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME    TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
                MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE       TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
                PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                   THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.

       2200-FETCH-CURSOR-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       2300-PROCESSA-CURSOR.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA'      TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
      *    IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
      *       PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
      *          THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
      *    END-IF.

           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2310-SELECT-MOVREC
                 THRU 2310-SELECT-MOVREC-EXIT
           END-IF.

           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2320-SELECT-TEXREC
                 THRU 2320-SELECT-TEXREC-EXIT
           END-IF.

           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2330-SELECT-MOVPEND
                 THRU 2330-SELECT-MOVPEND-EXIT
           END-IF.

           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2340-SELECT-TEXPEND
                 THRU 2340-SELECT-TEXPEND-EXIT
           END-IF.

           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2350-UPDATE-CURSOR
                 THRU 2350-UPDATE-CURSOR-EXIT
           END-IF.

           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2200-FETCH-CURSOR
                 THRU 2200-FETCH-CURSOR-EXIT
           END-IF.

       2300-PROCESSA-CURSOR-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       2310-SELECT-MOVREC.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '2310-SELECT-MOVREC'        TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
      *    IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
      *       PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
      *          THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
      *    END-IF.

           MOVE SWCD6302-CBAN               TO WS-CBAN.
           MOVE SWCD6302-CSPAI              TO WS-CSPAI.

           EXEC SQL
                 SELECT COUNT(*)
                   INTO :WS-MOVREC
                   FROM SWVT7201
                  WHERE IRECONC   = :CON-SIM
                    AND NCCCCBAN  = :WS-CBAN
                    AND NCCCCSPAI = :WS-CSPAI
                    AND MRDATL >= :WS-DATA-INI
                    AND MRDATL <= :WS-DATA-FIM
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE WS-SWVT7201                 TO AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           EVALUATE TRUE
           WHEN AQCW0011-OK
                CONTINUE
           WHEN AQCW0011-NOTFND
                MOVE SWCD6302-TOPREC        TO WS-MOVREC
                MOVE ZEROES                 TO WS-MOVREC
           WHEN OTHER
                SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL     TO TRUE
                SET  VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR     TO TRUE
                MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID     TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
                MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME    TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
                MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE       TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
                PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                   THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.

       2310-SELECT-MOVREC-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       2320-SELECT-TEXREC.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '2320-SELECT-TEXREC'        TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
      *    IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
      *       PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
      *          THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
      *    END-IF.

           MOVE SWCD6302-CBAN               TO WS-CBAN.
           MOVE SWCD6302-CSPAI              TO WS-CSPAI.

           EXEC SQL
                 SELECT COUNT(*)
                   INTO :WS-TEXREC
                   FROM SWVT5805
                  WHERE CCODEST     IN (:WS-RECONC, :WS-VALIDADA )
                    AND CBAN    = :WS-CBAN
                    AND CSPAI   = :WS-CSPAI
                    AND DATVAL >= :WS-DATA-INI
                    AND DATVAL <= :WS-DATA-FIM
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE WS-SWVT5805                 TO AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           EVALUATE TRUE
           WHEN AQCW0011-OK
                CONTINUE
           WHEN AQCW0011-NOTFND
                MOVE SWCD6302-TEXREC        TO WS-TEXREC
                MOVE ZEROES                 TO WS-TEXREC
           WHEN OTHER
                SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL     TO TRUE
                SET  VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR     TO TRUE
                MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID     TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
                MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME    TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
                MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE       TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
                PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                   THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.

       2320-SELECT-TEXREC-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       2330-SELECT-MOVPEND.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '2330-SELECT-MOVPEND'       TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
      *    IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
      *       PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
      *          THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
      *    END-IF.

           MOVE SWCD6302-CBAN               TO WS-CBAN.
           MOVE SWCD6302-CSPAI              TO WS-CSPAI.

           EXEC SQL
                 SELECT COUNT(*)
                   INTO :WS-MOVPEND
                   FROM SWVT7201
                  WHERE IRECONC  <> :CON-SIM
                    AND NCCCCBAN  = :WS-CBAN
                    AND NCCCCSPAI = :WS-CSPAI
                    AND MRDATL >= :WS-DATA-INI
                    AND MRDATL <= :WS-DATA-FIM
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE WS-SWVT7201                 TO AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           EVALUATE TRUE
           WHEN AQCW0011-OK
                CONTINUE
           WHEN AQCW0011-NOTFND
                MOVE SWCD6302-TOPPEND       TO WS-MOVPEND
                MOVE ZEROES                 TO WS-MOVPEND
           WHEN OTHER
                SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL     TO TRUE
                SET  VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR     TO TRUE
                MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID     TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
                MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME    TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
                MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE       TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
                PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                   THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.

       2330-SELECT-MOVPEND-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       2340-SELECT-TEXPEND.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '2340-SELECT-TEXPEND'       TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
      *    IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
      *       PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
      *          THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
      *    END-IF.

           MOVE SWCD6302-CBAN               TO WS-CBAN.
           MOVE SWCD6302-CSPAI              TO WS-CSPAI.

           EXEC SQL
                 SELECT COUNT(*)
                   INTO :WS-TEXPEND
                   FROM SWT58
                  WHERE CCODEST NOT IN (:WS-RECONC, :WS-VALIDADA )
                    AND CBAN    = :WS-CBAN
                    AND CSPAI   = :WS-CSPAI
                    AND DATVAL >= :WS-DATA-INI
                    AND DATVAL <= :WS-DATA-FIM
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE WS-SWVT5805                 TO AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           EVALUATE TRUE
           WHEN AQCW0011-OK
                CONTINUE
           WHEN AQCW0011-NOTFND
                MOVE SWCD6302-TEXPEND       TO WS-TEXPEND
                MOVE ZEROES                 TO WS-TEXPEND
           WHEN OTHER
                SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL     TO TRUE
                SET  VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR     TO TRUE
                MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID     TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
                MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME    TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
                MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE       TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
                PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                   THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.

       2340-SELECT-TEXPEND-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       2350-UPDATE-CURSOR.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '2350-UPDATE-CURSOR'        TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
      *    IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
      *       PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
      *          THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
      *    END-IF.

           IF  WS-MOVREC  EQUAL SWCD6302-TOPREC
           AND WS-TEXREC  EQUAL SWCD6302-TEXREC
           AND WS-MOVPEND EQUAL SWCD6302-TOPPEND
           AND WS-TEXPEND EQUAL SWCD6302-TEXPEND
               CONTINUE
           ELSE
              IF WS-MOVREC  NOT EQUAL SWCD6302-TOPREC
                 MOVE WS-MOVREC             TO SWCD6302-TOPREC
              END-IF
              IF WS-TEXREC  NOT EQUAL SWCD6302-TEXREC
                 MOVE WS-TEXREC             TO SWCD6302-TEXREC
              END-IF
              IF WS-MOVPEND NOT EQUAL SWCD6302-TOPPEND
                 MOVE WS-MOVPEND            TO SWCD6302-TOPPEND
              END-IF
              IF WS-TEXPEND NOT EQUAL SWCD6302-TEXPEND
                 MOVE WS-TEXPEND            TO SWCD6302-TEXPEND
              END-IF
              MOVE WS-PROGNAME              TO SWCD6302-CUSERID

              EXEC SQL
                   UPDATE SWVT6302
                      SET TOPREC   = :SWCD6302-TOPREC
                        , TEXREC   = :SWCD6302-TEXREC
                        , TOPPEND  = :SWCD6302-TOPPEND
                        , TEXPEND  = :SWCD6302-TEXPEND
                        , CUSERID  = :SWCD6302-CUSERID
                        , HTIMEEST = CURRENT TIMESTAMP
                    WHERE CURRENT OF CRS_SWT63
              END-EXEC

           MOVE WS-SWVT6302                 TO AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           EVALUATE TRUE
           WHEN AQCW0011-OK
                CONTINUE
           WHEN OTHER
                SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL     TO TRUE
                SET  VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR     TO TRUE
                MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID     TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
                MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME    TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
                MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE       TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
                PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                   THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.

       2350-UPDATE-CURSOR-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       3000-FIM-PROGRAMA.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '3000-FIM-PROGRAMA'         TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM AQCP0100-REG-FIM
                 THRU AQCP0100-REG-FIM-EXIT
           END-IF.

           PERFORM AQCP0002-TRATA-SYNCPOINT
              THRU AQCP0002-TRATA-SYNCPOINT-EXIT.

PRA        MOVE AQCW0009-RCODE             TO VIAL0100-RCODE.

       3000-FIM-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE AQCP0002 END-EXEC.
      ******************************************************************
           COPY VIAP0015.
           COPY AQCP0109.
           COPY VIAP0030.
           COPY AQCP0011.
      ******************************************************************
